cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use eCoSim in your work, please cite it as below."
title: eCoSim
type: software
abstract: >-
  eCoSim couples simulation models, such as FMI 2 and FMI 3 FMUs, MATLAB models and Python
  models, and steps them together, on one machine or on an HPC cluster. The results go into
  files or a PostgreSQL database.
authors:
